1 NOTE Sayri Tupac Yupanqui left Vilacabamba.
2 CONT It is said that he was poisoned by Friar Diego Ortiz. The kindly Friar was tortured and executed by Tupac Amaru Yupanqui in revenge. Every church in Vilacamba was raised to the ground.
2 CONT Sources:
