1 NOTE At the age of nine she was forced to marry Cristobal Maldonado, Brother of Arias Maldonado because she was heiress to Sayri Tupac's estates. It is said that she was raped by him to give greater empowerment to the mayoragzo. She wa
2 CONC s returned to the convent of Santa Clara until she was 15 years of age. Francisco de Toledo beguiles her into getting married again this time to Captain Martin Garcia de Loyola as a reward for capturing, Tupac Amaru.
2 CONT Source:
2 CONT Diccionario Historico - Biographico del Peru, Tomo 2ndo. Manuel de Mendiburu Lima. 1876
2 CONT http://www.cervantesvirtual.com, entry, Dona Maria Coya de Loyola Inca.
