2 CONT
2 CONT 6. ANA9 DE TREVINO (JOSEPH-DIEGO8 DE TREMINO-Y-QUINTANILLA, JOSE-DIEGO7 DE TREMINO, DIEGO6 TREMINO-DE-VELASCO, BERNARDINO5 FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO, FRANCISCO4, PEDRO3, JUAN2, PEDRO1) 
2 CONT *was born Abt. 1612, and died 04 Nov 1669 in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married (1) JUAN SERRANO-CABRERA, son of CRISTOBAL SERRANO and MARIA DE CABRERA. He was born in Sevilla, Spain, and died Abt. 1658 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married (2) SERGEANT MAJOR MIGUEL SANCHEZ-SAENZ 1624, son of CAPTAIN MIGUEL SANCHEZ-SAENZ-MONTRON. He was born 1580 in Spain.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for ANA DE TREVINO and MIGUEL SANCHEZ-SAENZ:
2 CONT *Marriage source:From the books, Fundadores de Nueva Galicia - Guadalajara - Tomo I, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal (Page 149), and Origin of the Surnames Garza and Trevino in Nuevo Leon by Tomas Mendirichaga Cueva.
2 CONT
