1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://books.google.com/books?id=JzPOmeeoX_MC&pg=PA623&lpg=PA623&dq=Francisco+Xavier+Aguilera+(1779+-+1828)&source=bl&ots=6UB5trvBtt&sig=SHtxNNOYJCMysk4k8kkW1u7QdNM&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwiF38KSsZ7KAhXIMSYKHUb0AzEQ
