2 CONT Pedro De La Garza Falcon,The Younger 
2 CONT *(son of Pedro De La Garza Falcon and Ines Rodriguez) was born Bet. 1612 - 1615 in Nuevo Reino de Leon,Mexico, and 
2 CONT *died 20 Nov 1695 in Monterrey,Nuevo Leon,Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married Maria De La Roche
2 CONT
