2 CONC  Mexico. She married CAPTAIN JUAN GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-OLEA January 28, 1668 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico, son of JUAN GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-DE-LOS-SANTOS and MARIA DE OLEA-CAMACHO. He was born Abt. 1640 in S
