2 CONT 25.  Francisco Gonzales De La Garza FALCON1 (Blas Maria Trevino De La Garza, Marcos  Alonzo Garza Y del Arcon) was born 1640 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, New Spain. He died  1718. Francisco married Leonor Fernandez SEPULVEDA.
2 CONC  Leonor was born 1652.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT * 57 M i. Teodoro Sepulveda De La Garza FALCON was born 17 Dec 1669 in Monterrey, 
2 CONT * Nuevo Leon, Mexico, New Spain.
2 CONT * + 58 M ii. Blas Maria Sepulveda De La Garza FALCON was born 1673 and died 1736.
2 CONT * 59 F iii. Nicolasa de la Garza Sepulveda FALCON.
2 CONT * 60 F iv. Maria de la Garza Sepulveda FALCON.
2 CONT * 61 M v. Jose Eugenio de la Garza Sepulveda FALCON.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.wadefalcon.com/ColonialSpanishFamiliesOfLouisiana/DeLaGarzaFalcon.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT ======================
2 CONT Sgt. Major Francisco DE LA GARZA FALCON934,1150 was born (date unknown). Parents: Capt. Blas DE LA GARZA FALCON and Beatriz GONZALEZ Hidalgo.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Leonor GARCIA DE SEPULVEDA (aka Leonor de Renteria). Leonor GARCIA DE SEPULVEDA (aka Leonor de Renteria) and Sgt. Major Francisco DE LA GARZA FALCON were married. Children were: Nicolasa DE LA GARZA FALCON (aka Nicolasa de
2 CONC  Renteria), Clemente DE LA GARZA, Capt. Joseph Eugenio DE LA GARZA FALCON, Margarita DE LA GARZA, Gregoria DE LA GARZA, Gen. Blas DE LA GARZA Falcon, Andrea DE LA GARZA (aka Andrea de Renteria), Teodoro DE LA GARZA, Alonzo (Juan Y
