2 CONC  Francisco de Longoria noted that Maria was 16 years old at the time of the investigation on May 21, 1681, and that she was "español". She died before 1695 at the age of 30.688 Parents: Capt. Alonso de TREVIÑO de la Garza and Mari
2 CONC a Mayor de RENTERIA.
2 CONT
