2 CONT 23. MARIA10 AYALA-OVALLE (DIEGO9 DE AYALA-TREVINO, JOSEPH-DIEGO8 DE TREMINO-Y-QUINTANILLA, JOSE-DIEGO7 DE TREMINO, DIEGO6 TREMINO-DE-VELASCO, BERNARDINO5 FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO, FRANCISCO4, PEDRO3, JUAN2, PEDRO1) 
2 CONT *was born Abt. 1645 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT *died 20 Feb 1702 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married CAPTAIN NICOLAS LOPEZ-PRIETO. He was born 1635 in San Francisco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MARIA AYALA-OVALLE and NICOLAS LOPEZ-PRIETO are:
2 CONT *i. MARGARITA11 LOPEZ-PRIETO, 
2 CONT **b. 1664; 
2 CONT **m. CAPTAIN BLAS DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR [2], 13 Jan 1681/82, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico3; 
2 CONT ***b. Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***d. May 1719, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
