2 CONT
2 CONT iv. MIGUEL TREVINO-RODRIGUEZ, b. 04 Aug 1683, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. MICAELA DE TREVINO-AYALA, b. 1662; m. ALFEREZ JUAN RUIZ-DE-OCON, 04 Feb 1681/82, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1660.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of VICENTE DE AYALA-Y-TREVINO and MARIA DE MONTALVO is:
2 CONT
