2 CONT 1584. Capitan Miguel MONTEMAYOR was born in 1588 in Saltillo,Coahuila,Mexico. He died on Oct 25 1643 in Hacienda de los Nogales,Nuevo Leon,Mexico. He married Monica RODRIGUEZ in 1618 in Monterrey,Nuevo Leon,Mexico. [Parents] 
