1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [added by Ronaldo G Gonzalez  7/19/2011]
2 CONT
2 CONT In the article below, there is mention of an '''Alfonso Acevedo''', brother of Josefa Acevedo, son of Jose Acevedo y Gomez. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.new-ventures.net/PDF/Preview/A%20Treatise%20on%20Domestic%20Economy%20preview.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT According to the article, Alfonso (or Alonso) Acevedo Tejada became a Lieutenant Colonel in the army of the Republic of Gran Colombia, and later became the Governor of New Granada.
2 CONT
2 CONT Pedro Romero Guerrero has a Geni entry for '''Alonso Ramon de Acevedo y Tejada''': http://www.geni.com/people/ALONSO-RAMON-DE-ACEVEDO-Y-TEJADA/6000000007729366429
2 CONT
2 CONT Unfortunately, Pedro Romero's Geni tree doesn't show a wife or any offspring of Alonso Ramon de Acevedo y Tejada. 
2 CONT
2 CONT It is not yet known whether the '''Alfonso Acevedo''' (b.1809) mentioned in the New Ventures article is the same person as the '''Alonso Ramon Acevedo y Tejada''' listed on Geni by Pedro Romero Guerrero. It is likely they are one 
2 CONC and the same person. 
2 CONT
2 CONT I'm afraid Alfonso (Alonso) Ramon Acevedo y Tejada is not the same person as the '''Ramon Acevedo''' listed by Joshua Arturo Gonzalez in 2007. The father of Arturo Acevedo Vallarino (founder of Acevedo e Hijos) was Gen. Ramon Acev
2 CONC edo Perez (not Acevedo Tejada). The mother of Ramon Acevedo Perez would have had a father named '''Perez'''. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The mother of Arturo Acevedo Vallarino would have had a father with the surname '''Vallarino'''. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The search for the parents of Ramon Acevedo Perez is ongoing as of July, 2011. 
