2 CONT
2 CONT 58.  Blas Maria Sepulveda De La Garza FALCON (Francisco Gonzales De La Garza, Blas Maria Trevino De La Garza, Marcos Alonzo Garza Y del Arcon) 
2 CONT *was born 1673 in Pesqueria China, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, New Spain. 
2 CONT *He died 1736 in San Juan Bautista, Coahuila, Mexico, New Spain.
2 CONT *BIOGRAPHY: Blas Maria was a governor of Coahuila 
2 CONT *Blas married Beatriz VILLARREAL on 14 Jan 1697 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, New Spain. 
2 CONT **Beatriz was born 1679.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT *1. 79 M i. Miguel Villarreal de la Garza FALCON 
2 CONT **was born 8 Oct 1699.
2 CONT *2. 80 F ii. Francisca Villarreal de la Garza FALCON 
2 CONT **was born 1705.
2 CONT *3. + 81 M iii. Blas Maria Villarreal de la Garza FALCON 
2 CONT **was born 1712 and 
2 CONT **died 1767.
2 CONT *4. 82 M iv. Jose Luis de la Garza Villareal FALCON.
2 CONT *5. 83 F v. Maria Candelaria de la Garza Villareal FALCON.
2 CONT *6. 84 F vi. Leonor Xaviera de la Garza Villareal FALCON.
2 CONT *7. 85 F vii. Juana Isabel de la Garza Villareal FALCON.
2 CONT *8. 86 M viii. Clemente de la Garza Villareal FALCON.
2 CONT *9. 87 F ix. Maria Ignacia de la Garza Villareal FALCON.
2 CONT *10. 88 M x. Pablo Mauricio de la Garza Villareal FALCON.
2 CONT *11. + 89 M xi. Joaquin Benito de la Garza Villareal FALCON.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.wadefalcon.com/ColonialSpanishFamiliesOfLouisiana/DeLaGarzaFalcon.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT =================
2 CONT
2 CONT Gen. Blas DE LA GARZA Falcon [1175],[1176] 
2 CONT *died circa 1736 in San Juan Bautista del Rio Grande del Norte (Guerrero, Coahuila). 
2 CONT *He was Governor of the province of Coahuila y Tejas from 1723-1729 and again from 1733-1735. 
2 CONT *Parents: Sgt. Major Francisco DE LA GARZA FALCON and Leonor GARCIA DE SEPULVEDA (aka Leonor de Renteria).
2 CONT *Spouse: Beatriz de VILLARREAL. Beatriz de VILLARREAL and Gen. Blas DE LA GARZA Falcon were married on 14 January 1698.[1173] Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Miguel DE LA GARZA Falcon, 
2 CONT *2. Juana Isabel DE LA GARZA Falcon, 
2 CONT *3. Leonor DE LA GARZA Falcon, 
2 CONT *4. Francisca Xaviera DE LA GARZA Falcon, 
2 CONT *5. Capt. Blas Maria DE LA GARZA Falcon, 
2 CONT *6. Maria Candelaria DE LA GARZA, 
2 CONT *7. Joseph Luis DE LA GARZA FALCON, 
2 CONT *8. Maria Ignacia DE LA GARZA Falcon, 
2 CONT *9. Pablo Mauricio DE LA GARZA Falcon, 
2 CONT *10. Joaquin DE LA GARZA Falcon, 
2 CONT *11. Mariana DE LA GARZA Falcon.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b49.html#P7564
2 CONT
2 CONT ==============================
2 CONT
2 CONT 110. GOVERNOR BLAS4 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-SEPULVEDA (FRANCISCO3 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON, BLAS MARIA2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) 
2 CONT *was born May 01, 1673 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT *died January 21, 1736 in San Juan Bautista del Rio Grande, Guerrero, Coahulia, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married BEATRIZ DE VILLARREAL January 14, 1698 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **daughter of JUAN DE VILLARREAL and LUISA DE-LA-GARZA-GARCIA. She was born in Monterrey, N.L., and 
2 CONT **died March 29, 1746 in San Pedro, Boca de Leones, Villaldama, Nuevo Leon, Mexico1.
2 CONT ***Notes for GOVERNOR BLAS DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-SEPULVEDA: He served twice as Governor of Coahulia and Texas - 1723-1729 and 1733-1735. The Handbook of Texas Online: Origin of the surnames Garza and Trevino in Nuevo Leon by Tomas Me
2 CONC ndirichaga Cueva. Page 27. Northern New Spain, A Research Guide by Thomas C. Barnes, Thomas H. Naylor, and Charles W. Polzer.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of BLAS DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-SEPULVEDA and BEATRIZ DE VILLARREAL are:
2 CONT *1. i. CAPTAIN MIGUEL5 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-VILLARREAL, 
2 CONT **b. October 08, 1699, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon,Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. August 26, 1753, Presido San Francisco Xavier de Gigedo, Texas.
2 CONT ***Notes for CAPTAIN MIGUEL DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-VILLARREAL: Explorer, colonizer, and soldier. Founder of Falcon, Texas.
2 CONT **He was married but his wife's name is unknown.
2 CONT ***Source: The Handbook of Texas Online.
2 CONT *2. ii. CLEMENTE DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1700.
2 CONT ***Notes for CLEMENTE DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON: After his father's death in 1735, he served as Governor of Coahulia.
2 CONT *3. 382. iii. JUANA-ISABEL DE-LA-GARZA-VILLARREAL, 
2 CONT **b. June 06, 1701, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *4. 383. iv. LEONOR-JAVIERA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1703.
2 CONT *5. 384. v. FRANCISCA DE-LA-GARZA-VILLARREAL, 
2 CONT **b. 1700.
2 CONT *6. 385. vi. MARIA-CANDELARIA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON, 
2 CONT **b. 1709.
2 CONT *7. vii. JOSEPH-LUIS DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1711, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. MANUELA GONZALEZ-VILLARREAL, February 09, 1745, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1725.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for JOSEPH-LUIS DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON and MANUELA GONZALEZ-VILLARREAL: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 105.
2 CONT *8. 386. viii. CAPTAIN BLAS-MARIA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON, 
2 CONT **b. 1712, Real de las Salinas, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. 1767, Camargo, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *9. ix. MARIA-IGNACIA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1713; 
2 CONT **m. CAPTAIN IGNACIO GUERRA-CANAMAR-DEL-BOSQUE, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1703, Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *10. x. PABLO-MAURICIO DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1715.
2 CONT *11. 387. xi. JOAQUIN-BENITO DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1716.
2 CONT *12. 388. xii. MARIANA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-VILLARREAL, 
2 CONT **b. 1717.
2 CONT
