2 CONT
2 CONT Nicolasa Fernandez is the daughter of Captain Gregorio Fernandez and Maria Gonzalez. Maria Gonzalez is the daughter of Sargent-major Diego Gonzalez and Maria Ochoa. Nicolasa is the paternal great-grandaughter of Captain Blas de la
