2 CONT =======================
2 CONT 17. ELENA4 CAVAZOS-MONTEMAYOR (ANTONIO3 CAVAZOS-DE-LA-GARZA, JUAN2 CAVAZOS-DEL-CAMPO, GABRIEL1 CAVAZOS) was born 07 Mar 1675/76 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died 1710. She married CAPTAIN JUAN GUER
2 CONC RA-CANAMAR Sep 1694 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of VICENTE GUERRA-CANAMAR-VELA and DOMINGA. He was born 19 Mar 1663/64 in Villa de Santa Maria de los Lagos, Jalisco, Mexico, and died Dec 1718 in C
2 CONC erralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ELENA CAVAZOS-MONTEMAYOR and JUAN GUERRA-CANAMAR are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. MARIA JOSEFA5 GUERRA-CANAMAR-CAVAZOS, b. 1696, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. Guerrero Viejo, Tamaulipas, Mexico; m. NICOLAS DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-SEPULVEDA, 02 Sep 1714, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b
2 CONC . 1694.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for MARIA GUERRA-CANAMAR-CAVAZOS and NICOLAS DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-SEPULVEDA:
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage record from the book Index Marriage Investigation from the Diocese of Guadalajara.
2 CONT
2 CONT Page 59. Film #0167984
2 CONT
2 CONT 65. ii. ANTONIA-MARGARITA GUERRA-CANAMAR-CAVAZOS, b. 1702, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. 1770, Guerrero Viejo, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 66. iii. JUAN-AMADOR GUERRA-CANAMAR-CAVAZOS, b. 1703, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. Abt. 1752.
2 CONT
2 CONT 67. iv. JOSEPH GUERRA-CANAMAR-CAVAZOS, b. 1705, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 68. v. CAPTAIN VICENTE GUERRA-CANAMAR-CAVAZOS, b. 02 Aug 1705, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. Bef. 1753, Guerrero Viejo, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT
