1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Francisco de LONGORIA Rodriguez [688],[2290] 
2 CONT *was born in 1660 in Nuevo Leon.[688],[2291] He was a natural son, meaning his parents were not married by the Catholic Church. The marriage investigation for Francisco and Maria de Treviño Renteria (aka Maria Rodriguez) noted tha
2 CONC t Francisco was 22 years old at the time of the investigation on May 21, 1681, and that he was "español" (meaning not likely to have Native American ancestry).
2 CONT *At the time of his marriage to Josepha de la Cadena, he was a citizen of "del real y minas de las Salinas", a mining community north of Monterrey. 
2 CONT *Parents: Lorenzo Suarez de LONGORIA Salazar and Antonia Perez RODRIGUEZ.
2 CONT *Spouse: Maria de TREVIÑO RENTERIA (aka Maria RODRIGUEZ). Maria de TREVIÑO RENTERIA (aka Maria RODRIGUEZ) and Francisco de LONGORIA Rodriguez were married after 31 May 1681.[688],[2290]
2 CONT *Spouse: Josepha de la CADENA. Josepha de la CADENA and Francisco de LONGORIA Rodriguez were married about 1695 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, New Spain.[688]
2 CONT
