2 CONC Y Brena Cavallero, 24 Dec 1776; citing El Sagrario, Lima, Lima, Peru,''' reference v 15 p 58, index based upon data collected by the Genealogical Society of Utah, Salt Lake City; FHL microfilm 1,109,539.
